.TH tictacli-server 1
.SH NAME
tictacli-server \- TicTacToe WebSocket server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tictacli-server
.SH DESCRIPTION
TicTacToe WebSocket server that handles client connections, matchmaking, global ranking, and real-time spectating.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBTICTACTOE_BIND\fR
Address to bind to (e.g. 127.0.0.1:8080).
.TP
\fBTICTACTOE_ENV\fR
Environment profile (e.g. production).
.TP
\fBRUST_LOG\fR
Logging configuration.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start server:
.B tictacli-server
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtictacli\fR(1)
